  "post_content": "<p>La cafeter&iacute;a Paradise en Onda se ha llenado la tarde de este s&aacute;bado de incondicionales para escuchar el genuino blues del tr&iacute;o local Colombo.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/12/IMG_2908.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La actuaci&oacute;n se ha cerrado con la interpretaci&oacute;n de varios temas por parte de los hermanos Calpe G&oacute;mez.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colomboparadise/img_2903.jpg\" alt=\"img_2903\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colomboparadise/img_2904.jpg\" alt=\"img_2904\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colomboparadise/img_2905.jpg\" alt=\"img_2905\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colomboparadise/img_2906.jpg\" alt=\"img_2906\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colomboparadise/img_2907.jpg\" alt=\"img_2907\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colomboparadise/img_2908.jpg\" alt=\"img_2908\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colomboparadise/img_2909.jpg\" alt=\"img_2909\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colomboparadise/img_2910.jpg\" alt=\"img_2910\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colomboparadise/img_2911.jpg\" alt=\"img_2911\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/colomboparadise/img_2912.jp